ontwikkelen van </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplinaire</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> projecten. Onderzoek van het lectoraat </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Transdisciplinair</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> Samenwerken in Onderwijs, heeft inzichten en ervaringen verzameld bij dit soort </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; background-position: 0px 100%; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQiPjxnIGZpbGw9Im5vbmUiIGZpbGwtcnVsZT0iZXZlbm9kZCI+PHBhdGggc3Ryb2tlPSIjRUIwMDAwIiBkPSJNMCAzYzEuMjUgMCAxLjI1LTIgMi41LTJTMy43NSAzIDUgMyIvPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0wIDBoNXY0SDB6Ii8+PC9nPjwvc3ZnPg==&quot;); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;">pioners</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> van hogescholen en universiteiten door Nederland. Samen biedt dat een handzaam inkijkje in de praktijk van het ontwikkelen en implementeren van </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplinair</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> onderwijs.</span></span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-wrap-mode: nowrap !important;">&nbsp;</span><br class="SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-wrap-mode: nowrap !important;"></span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun EmptyTextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20.85px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;"></span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 20.85px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-wrap-mode: nowrap !important;">&nbsp;</span><br class="SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-s