n></p></div><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; position: relative;"><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW74760962 BCX8" role="list" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; cursor: text; font-family: verdana; overflow: visible;"><li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="44" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="5" data-aria-level="1" role="listitem" class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; display: block; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW74760962 BCX8" paraid="190434426" paraeid="{5ba601d7-b613-469d-b1e7-192efb64f28e}{11}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Klein beginnen, langzaam groeien</span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-wrap-mode: nowrap !important;">&nbsp;</span><br class="SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-wrap-mode: nowrap !important;"></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Begin klein met een doelgericht team en benut innovatiegelden om te experimenteren. In </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; background-position: 0px 100%; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjQiPjxnIGZpbGw9Im5vbmUiIGZpbGwtcnVsZT0iZXZlbm9kZCI+PHBhdGggc3Ryb2tlPSIjRUIwMDAwIiBkPSJNMCAzYzEuMjUgMCAxLjI1LTIgMi41LTJTMy43NSAzIDUgMyIvPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0wIDBoNXY0SDB6Ii8+PC9nPjwvc3ZnPg==&quot;); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;">extracurriculaire</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> onderwijsruimte is vaak meer ruimte om te experimenteren. Wanneer je van start bent: ga connecties aan, creëer meer enthousiasme en zoek langzaam steun binnen de instelling. Bouw mee aan bruggen tussen de ‘silo's’ van losse afdelingen of faculteiten binnen en instelling. Neem tijd om te ontwikkelen, en streef naar vaste implementatie in het curriculum en financiering op de middellange termijn.&nbsp;</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW74760962 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; position: relative;"><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW74760962 BCX8" role="list" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; cursor: text; font-family: verdana; overflow: visible;"><li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="44" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="6" data-aria-level="1" role="listitem" class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; display: block; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW74760962 BCX8" paraid="1196766677" paraeid="{5ba601d7-b613-469d-b1e7-192efb64f28e}{23}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Wees realistisch over uitdagingen</span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-wrap-mode: nowrap !important;">&nbsp;</span><br class="SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-wrap-mode: nowrap !important;"></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">Pas als je je voorbereidt op de uitdagingen, kan je ze overwinnen. Houd dus rekening met beperkte middelen, starre eisenlijstjes, scepsis bij collega's en de noodzaak tot rolverandering bij docenten en studenten. Besef: het komt vaker voor en kost tijd, maar je eigen drive kan overspringen op anderen.</span><span class="EOP SCXW74760962 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW74760962 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; position: relative;"><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW74760962 BCX8" role="list" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; cursor: text; font-family: verdana; overflow: visible;"><li aria-set